   * @x-autobe-authorization-type join
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor administrator
   * @x-autobe-specification Implement administrator self-registration by validating the submitted credentials, creating a new administrator account record, and issuing JWT access and refresh tokens on success. The service must enforce uniqueness of the administrator email, hash the password before persistence, initialize the account security state in the administrator table, and create an administrator session record so the refresh token can be tracked and revoked later.
