   * @x-autobe-specification Validate administrator email and password credentials, verify that the account is active and eligible for login, then issue fresh JWT access and refresh tokens. The implementation must compare the submitted password against the stored password hash in the administrator account record, reject invalid credentials, and create or update the administrator session tracking record for the new token pair.
